{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEMO CONTENT:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the DEMO section, players work as teams to capture the territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- The game ends when one team captures all the territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- The team with the most territories wins when the countdown ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- If the countdown ends with a tie, the match ends in a draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SUPPORTED FEATURES AND LANGUAGES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- This game can be played with a keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Use the 1, 2, and 3 keys to use weapons, and use Q to quickly switch between weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Currently, only English is supported. Other languages will be added in the next stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I hope you enjoy it. Don't forget to leave feedback and <strong>ADD TO WISHLIST</strong>. Have fun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900020?t=1753884682","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900020?t=1753884682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900020/933fba8d2910e13400582fbecf677592c1f6c220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753884682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900020/933fba8d2910e13400582fbecf677592c1f6c220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753884682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game uses various weapons to kill rival players. Blood effects appear on characters hit by bullets.\r\n\r\nThe game contains elements of war, conflict, and armed violence.\r\n\r\nThe game contains no sexual content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEMO CONTENT:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the DEMO section, players work as teams to capture the territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- The game ends when one team captures all the territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- The team with the most territories wins when the countdown ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- If the countdown ends with a tie, the match ends in a draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SUPPORTED FEATURES AND LANGUAGES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- This game can be played with a keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Use the 1, 2, and 3 keys to use weapons, and use Q to quickly switch between weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Currently, only English is supported. Other languages will be added in the next stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I hope you enjoy it. Don't forget to leave feedback and <strong>ADD TO WISHLIST</strong>. Have fun.</p>","developers":["K\u00e2z\u0131m KINCI"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3895160","name":"Critical Ops - Dead Zone"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900020/cb7c4828a9f2945e02ba28dccbcc818a8eecf98d/header.jpg?t=1753884682","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257172389,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172389/movie480.mp4?t=1753383540","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172389/movie_max.mp4?t=1753383540"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257172389/7c5628454781f9719daf5abcb4d7f72f8f35d265/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753383540","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172389/movie480_vp9.we